      "defect": "false-claim",
      "evidence": "The step says the maximum is attained “at r=λ'_{k+1} (at r=0 when k≥λ'_1, with the convention λ'_{k+1}=0).” For λ=(2) and k=1, k≥λ'_1=1, but λ'_2=1 and max_{r≥0}(Σ_{i≤r}λ_i−rk)=1, attained at r=1, not r=0. The parenthetical is false (the main maximum formula remains valid).",
